omatree (0.1.2) unstable; urgency=low

  * Windows support (x64 installer); for Linux packages the changes are
    the two fixes below.
  * Markdown Preview no longer swallows the application's keyboard
    shortcuts: Ctrl+E (and Ctrl+F, Ctrl+S, Ctrl+N, F1, F2, Alt+Up, ...)
    now work while Preview is shown.
  * Shortcut names shown in hints, menus and the F1 reference are derived
    from the platform more reliably.

 -- OmaTree project <261649146+Dorotabro@users.noreply.github.com>  Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000

omatree (0.1.1) unstable; urgency=low

  * macOS support (Apple Silicon): no change for Linux packages except
    that OmaTree's own dialog buttons are labelled in English whatever
    the system language, and the Open/New/Save/Find shortcuts now come
    from Qt's standard keys (still Ctrl+O, Ctrl+N, Ctrl+S, Ctrl+F).

 -- OmaTree project <261649146+Dorotabro@users.noreply.github.com>  Tue, 06 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000

omatree (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial package of OmaTree 0.1.0.

